265
00:17:09,237 --> 00:17:11,030
Bin drin. <i>Cuff</i> aufblasen!

266
00:17:13,282 --> 00:17:15,076
Endtidal, exzellente Kurve.

267
00:17:15,952 --> 00:17:17,495
Gute Atemgeräusche.

268
